{
  "title": "TinyHouse",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "3-osc wavetable",
        "synth. 8 voices",
        "poly or mono.",
        "",
        "3 wavetable oscs,",
        "sub, noise, multi-",
        "mode filter and",
        "two envelopes.",
        "",
        "Presets, modu-",
        "lation and knob",
        "mapping are all",
        "Schwung's own, from",
        "the slot settings.",
        "",
        "Based on Wavetable",
        "by Roland Rabien",
        "(FigBug), BSD-3."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Wavetables",
      "lines": [
        "Tables live in",
        "UserLibrary/",
        " Wavetables.",
        "",
        "Drop .wav files",
        "there via Move",
        "Manager or the",
        "schwung manager.",
        "",
        "Serum, Vital and",
        "Ableton exports",
        "work. Any frame",
        "size: 2048, 512,",
        "256, 128, or one",
        "single cycle.",
        "",
        "Frame size is read",
        "from the file's",
        "own harmonics, so",
        "short tables play",
        "at the right pitch",
        "with no metadata.",
        "",
        "115 factory tables",
        "are seeded on",
        "first run.",
        "",
        "On the OSC page,",
        "turn knobs 1/2 to",
        "step tables (OSC 3",
        "has its own), or",
        "click to browse",
        "with live preview."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Stock Schwung UI:",
        "jog scrolls, click",
        "opens, Back goes",
        "up. Knobs 1-8 play",
        "the open page.",
        "",
        "Main: the ones to",
        " ride. Cutoff, res,",
        " flt env + decay,",
        " sub, amp decay +",
        " release, space",
        "Osc: tables, pos,",
        " level, tune",
        "Unison / Shape",
        "Osc 3: the layer",
        "Filter: cutoff,",
        " res, type, sub,",
        " noise, drive",
        "Env 1: amp + flt",
        "Env 2: two spare",
        " envelopes",
        "Env Mod: tracking",
        " + where the two",
        " spare ones go",
        "Space: delay, reverb",
        "Space 2: width and",
        " the delay extras",
        "EQ 1, EQ 2: 4 bands",
        "Global",
        "",
        "Presets are",
        "Schwung's own: jog",
        "to the last page,",
        "My Presets, and",
        "open Preset."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Unison + Sync",
      "lines": [
        "Unison goes to 16",
        "on every osc, from",
        "one shared budget",
        "of 64 oscillators.",
        "",
        "Voices divides it:",
        "8 voices share 8",
        "each, 4 share 16.",
        "Mono gets it all.",
        "Stacks shrink to",
        "fit, so lower",
        "Voices for wider",
        "chords.",
        "",
        "Filter Drive adds",
        "warmth and level",
        "and rounds off a",
        "ringing resonance.",
        "",
        "Sync on SHAPE adds",
        "a formant without",
        "moving the pitch.",
        "Point an envelope",
        "at it to sweep it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Space + EQ",
      "lines": [
        "The effects a preset",
        "carries: delay,",
        "reverb, width and a",
        "4-band EQ. They sit",
        "after the voices.",
        "",
        "SPACE, on the main",
        "page, scales delay",
        "and reverb together.",
        "100 is the preset",
        "as it was made.",
        "",
        "SPACE page: delay",
        "above, reverb below.",
        "SPACE 2: width, the",
        "right delay time,",
        "delay mode, low cuts.",
        "",
        "EQ 1, EQ 2: four",
        "bands. Type is Bell,",
        "a shelf or a cut.",
        "Gain does nothing",
        "on a cut."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mod Envelopes",
      "lines": [
        "Env 2 holds two",
        "envelopes that go",
        "wherever you point",
        "them.",
        "",
        "On ENV MOD pick a",
        "destination for",
        "each and how much.",
        "",
        "WT Pos is the one",
        "to try: a decaying",
        "envelope there",
        "starts full and",
        "settles gentler,",
        "which is what",
        "makes a wavetable",
        "sound struck",
        "rather than held.",
        "",
        "Amount is bipolar.",
        "Centre is off; the",
        "lower half sweeps",
        "the other way.",
        "",
        "An LFO cannot do",
        "this shape: it",
        "repeats, and the",
        "point here is that",
        "it does not."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MIDI",
      "lines": [
        "Notes, velocity,",
        "pitch bend (range",
        "on GLOBAL page),",
        "mod wheel (CC 1),",
        "sustain (CC 64),",
        "aftertouch.",
        "",
        "Mod wheel, after-",
        "touch and pitch",
        "bend are also mod",
        "matrix sources."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credits",
      "lines": [
        "Sound engine after",
        "Wavetable + gin by",
        "Roland Rabien",
        "(BSD-3).",
        "",
        "Filter DSP:",
        "AudioFilter (MZTi).",
        "FLAC: dr_flac.",
        "Pink noise: Thomas",
        "Merchant (MIT).",
        "",
        "Wavetables:",
        "Adventure Kid",
        "(AKWF, public",
        "domain) and Neu",
        "KatalYst (free).",
        "",
        "Port for Schwung:",
        "athousanddetails."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
